+| 2 | **The bus stop** | He smokes. He sees the MISSING notice that he pasted there. He takes the bus to the cliff. See [[Street and Bus]]. | Drawn |
+| 3 | **[[The Cliff]]** | He walks through the snapped tape and past its light. A raven stands on the tape post and watches him. | Drawn |
+| 4 | **The cliff edge** | He walks to the end of the cliff and jumps. | Drawn |
+| 5 | **[[The Rock Path]]** | He wakes on a rock path in the sea, after the jump, and walks to the Building under the moon. | Drawn |
+| 6 | **The [[Lobby]]** | His first entrance. [[Leon]], and [[The Cigarette Gag]]. | To draw |
+| 7 | **[[Room 202]], the first hour** | His first stay in his room. | To draw |
