+# Abilities and Gates
+
+From the redesign of [[Otto]]'s main world, 13 November 2026. See [[Round 15 Decision Record]], [[The Walk]] and [[Locks and Openers]].
+
+Each maze leaves Otto one sense that is also a way across. None of them hurts a shadow. Each one weakens him while he uses it, which is what protects the horror. **Senses, never strength.**
+
+## The abilities
+
+| Day and giver | The maze | What Otto keeps | The gate it opens | Its limit |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Day 1, [[Eve]] | [[Mirror Maze]] | **Flash.** Free light with a short recharge. Its afterimage opens a passage by alignment. | Dark smoke; a seam that matches a shape he has burned | It carves and does not kill. It wakes Sleepers. The burn fades. |
+| Day 2, [[Elle]] | [[The Sleep Maze]] | **Dreamwalk.** He sits, shuts his eyes and gets up as the dreamer. Corners tip, so end walls and ceilings are floor. What the dreamer opens stays open. | A door bolted from inside, a hatch overhead, a room whose floor is gone. Elle's footprints on the ceiling mark it. | He needs a seat. The dreamer has no camera, and a lamp wakes him. His sleep wakes Sleepers. |
+| Day 3, [[Pip]] | The blind mazes | **Echo.** He plays Pip's cry from the tape recorder. For a few seconds the true walls show as crayon line. | A papered-over doorway, a room that exists only on the blueprint, a room with no light | It reaches a few metres, and every Listener hears it. The Vacancy can forge an echo. |
+| Day 3 and Day 6, Pip's operations | [[The Cataract Operations]] | **The filter.** One ring on the lens with two glasses. UV shows residue: prints and trails. NIR shows the old plan under the paper. See [[Filters]]. | None. It shows the correct path where a way forks. | It works only through the raised finder. What it shows is true. |
+| Day 4, [[Leon]] and [[Noel]] | The Blot and the Fold | **Fold.** On a crease he folds the Schedule page. The whole half prints onto the missing half until he unfolds. | Half a stair, a door with no twin, a corridor that stops at a seam. WET PAINT marks it. | A fold prints everything, shadows included, and it works only at a crease. |
+| Day 5, floor 5 | The lung maze | **The level.** In standing water he centres the bubble and goes under, into the same room drowned and upside down. | Standing water: a leak, a wet floor, a sink. See [[Clause 10 — Standing Water]]. | The bubble is his breath. The camera stays shut below. |
+| Day 6, [[Nan]] | The Turn | No new verb. Doors dressed for 1998 answer his knock. | The exit through the past | It opens only what she remembers. |
+| Days 2 to 6, [[Renner]] | Tuning his line | Nothing of Otto's. One service door a day, and the day's lift stop. | STAFF ONLY doors, the riser, a dead lift stop | One a day. |
+
+## Rules
+
+- **Two layers of lock.** Renner's line opens the way forward, one door a day. The four faculties, Dreamwalk, Echo, Fold and the level, open the way back.
+- **Two tools from Pip.** Echo is sound: quick, short and loud, and the Vacancy can forge it. The filter is optics: slow, silent and true. Echo finds a way, and the filter settles whether the way is real.
+- **Each ability is also a way of looking.** Dreamwalk shows what exists only in sleep. Echo shows what the walls hide. Fold shows what is not symmetric. The level shows what is not level. Each gives old floors a new class of anomaly without new rooms.
+- **Every gate is seen at least a day before it opens.**
+- **Day 6 adds no verb.** The end of the game is too late to teach one.
+
+## The gate map
+
+Sixteen gates. Each ability has one first use on its own day and two or three gates on floors Otto already knows. Floor 2 has a gate for every ability, so home is never finished.
+
+- **[[Room 222]].** It opens to the afterimage of its own door frame. See [[Connectors and Routes]], chain A.
+- **The wet-paint stair.** Fold is the reason the block lifts. See [[Stairwell]].
+- **The water.** The level opens the leak by [[Room 232]], the cafeteria's dish pit and a puddle in the [[Lobby]]. From under the lobby he sees the chained well from below and cannot touch it.
+- **New places behind gates:** the lodge and the post room in the lobby, and the pantry.
+
+🔧 The full grid of sixteen gates exists only as a diagram in the redesign plan. It is to be atomized from there.
+
+## In the opening dream
+
+The floor turns on certain surfaces as soon as he walks onto them. It works like Dreamwalk, with no seat and no button, because he cannot fall asleep inside his own dream. See [[The Opening Dream]].
+
+## In the demo
+
+Echo, Fold and the level stay out of the demo. Their gates appear in it as closed markers, which is the hook.
+
+## 🔧 Open
+- A parked proposal: wet floors as a way between zones, with the spirit level in hand. See [[07 DEED — The Family]].
+- The UV orb piece of [[04 RADAR — Detection]] and its relation to the filter.
